{"seq":2,"slug":"graph-traversal","title":"图的遍历","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/graph-theory/graph-traversal","wordCount":1535,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"图的遍历\">图的遍历</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>图的遍历（Graph Traversal）是从某个顶点出发，按照特定策略系统地访问图中所有可达顶点的过程。两种基本遍历策略——<strong>广度优先搜索</strong>（BFS）和<strong>深度优先搜索</strong>（DFS）——是几乎所有图算法的基础。它们不仅用于遍历本身，更是解决最短路径、连通性、拓扑排序、环检测等问题的核心工具。</p>\n<p>BFS 按&quot;层次&quot;逐步探索，先访问距起点近的顶点；DFS 沿着一条路径深入到底再回溯。两者的区别在于使用的数据结构：BFS 用队列，DFS 用栈（或递归调用栈）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[图遍历]&#10;    A --&gt; B[BFS 广度优先]&#10;    A --&gt; C[DFS 深度优先]&#10;    B --&gt; D[队列]&#10;    C --&gt; E[栈/递归]&#10;    B --&gt; F[最短路径]&#10;    B --&gt; G[层次遍历]&#10;    C --&gt; H[拓扑排序]&#10;    C --&gt; I[连通分量]&#10;    C --&gt; J[环检测]&#10;    C --&gt; K[强连通分量]\">graph TB\n    A[图遍历]\n    A --&gt; B[BFS 广度优先]\n    A --&gt; C[DFS 深度优先]\n    B --&gt; D[队列]\n    C --&gt; E[栈/递归]\n    B --&gt; F[最短路径]\n    B --&gt; G[层次遍历]\n    C --&gt; H[拓扑排序]\n    C --&gt; I[连通分量]\n    C --&gt; J[环检测]\n    C --&gt; K[强连通分量]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>BFS</th>\n<th>DFS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据结构</td>\n<td>队列（FIFO）</td>\n<td>栈（LIFO）/递归</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)（最宽层）</td>\n<td>O(n)（最深路径）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n + m)</td>\n<td>O(n + m)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路径特性</td>\n<td>找到最短路径（无权图）</td>\n<td>不保证最短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>层次分析、最短路径</td>\n<td>回溯、拓扑排序、环检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遍历顺序</td>\n<td>由近到远</td>\n<td>深入再回溯</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"广度优先搜索-bfs\">广度优先搜索（BFS）</h2><p>BFS 从起始顶点开始，先访问所有距离为 1 的顶点，再访问距离为 2 的顶点，以此类推。BFS 的关键性质是：<strong>在无权图中，BFS 找到的路径就是最短路径</strong>。</p>\n<p>BFS 的实现使用队列。每次从队列取出一个顶点 u，遍历 u 的所有未访问邻居，将它们标记为已访问并加入队列。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function bfs(graph: Map&lt;number, number[]&gt;, start: number): Map&lt;number, number&gt; {&#10;  const distance = new Map&lt;number, number&gt;();&#10;  const queue: number[] = [start];&#10;  distance.set(start, 0);&#10;&#10;  while (queue.length &gt; 0) {&#10;    const u = queue.shift()!;&#10;    for (const v of graph.get(u) ?? []) {&#10;      if (!distance.has(v)) {&#10;        distance.set(v, distance.get(u)! + 1);&#10;        queue.push(v);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return distance;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> distance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> queue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [start];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  distance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(start, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (queue.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shift</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(u) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">distance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        distance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v, distance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(u)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distance;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>BFS 的应用场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>最短路径</strong>（无权图）：BFS 天然计算从起点到所有顶点的最短距离</li>\n<li><strong>层次遍历</strong>：按层访问树或图中的节点（如二叉树的层序遍历）</li>\n<li><strong>连通性检测</strong>：从一个顶点出发 BFS 能到达的所有顶点构成一个连通分量</li>\n<li><strong>二部图判定</strong>：BFS 中交替着色，如果发现同色邻居则不是二部图</li>\n<li><strong>社交网络中的 N 度人脉</strong>：BFS 遍历恰好 N 层就得到 N 度人脉</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在 Web 领域，BFS 最直接的应用是<strong>网页爬虫</strong>。从种子 URL 出发，将当前页面的所有链接加入队列，逐层爬取。BFS 策略保证先爬取&quot;距离近&quot;的页面，适合发现网站的核心结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"深度优先搜索-dfs\">深度优先搜索（DFS）</h2><p>DFS 从起始顶点出发，沿着一条路径深入到无法继续前进时回溯，然后探索下一条路径。DFS 可以用递归或显式栈实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function dfs(graph: Map&lt;number, number[]&gt;, start: number, visited: Set&lt;number&gt; = new Set()): number[] {&#10;  visited.add(start);&#10;  const result = [start];&#10;&#10;  for (const neighbor of graph.get(start) ?? []) {&#10;    if (!visited.has(neighbor)) {&#10;      result.push(...dfs(graph, neighbor, visited));&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">visited</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  visited.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(start);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [start];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> neighbor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(start) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">visited.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(neighbor)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(graph, neighbor, visited));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>DFS 产生的遍历树将图的边分为四类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>边类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>树边 (Tree Edge)</td>\n<td>DFS 树中的边</td>\n<td>构成 DFS 树</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回边 (Back Edge)</td>\n<td>指向祖先的边</td>\n<td>环检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前向边 (Forward Edge)</td>\n<td>指向后代的非树边</td>\n<td>有向图特有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交叉边 (Cross Edge)</td>\n<td>连接不同子树的边</td>\n<td>有向图特有</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>回边的存在 ⟺ 图中有环</strong>。这是 DFS 环检测的理论基础。在有向图中，如果 DFS 过程中遇到一个正在访问（灰色）的顶点，就发现了一条回边，即图中存在环。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function hasCycle(graph: Map&lt;number, number[]&gt;, n: number): boolean {&#10;  const WHITE = 0,&#10;    GRAY = 1,&#10;    BLACK = 2;&#10;  const color = new Array(n).fill(WHITE);&#10;&#10;  const dfsVisit = (u: number): boolean =&gt; {&#10;    color[u] = GRAY;&#10;    for (const v of graph.get(u) ?? []) {&#10;      if (color[v] === GRAY) return true;&#10;      if (color[v] === WHITE &amp;&amp; dfsVisit(v)) return true;&#10;    }&#10;    color[u] = BLACK;&#10;    return false;&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;    if (color[i] === WHITE &amp;&amp; dfsVisit(i)) return true;&#10;  }&#10;  return false;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hasCycle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> WHITE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    GRAY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    BLACK</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">WHITE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dfsVisit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">u</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    color[u] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GRAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(u) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (color[v] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GRAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (color[v] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> WHITE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dfsVisit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    color[u] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BLACK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (color[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> WHITE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dfsVisit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"连通性与连通分量\">连通性与连通分量</h2><p><strong>连通性</strong>是图论中最基本的结构性质。无向图是连通的，当且仅当任意两个顶点之间存在路径。如果图不连通，它由若干<strong>连通分量</strong>组成，每个分量是一个极大连通子图。</p>\n<p>对无向图，一次完整的 BFS 或 DFS（从未访问的顶点重启）可以在 O(n+m) 时间内找到所有连通分量。</p>\n<p>对有向图，连通性更复杂。<strong>强连通分量</strong>（SCC）是有向图中任意两个顶点之间都有有向路径的极大子图。Tarjan 算法和 Kosaraju 算法都能在 O(n+m) 时间内找到所有 SCC。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph SCC1&#10;        A --&gt; B&#10;        B --&gt; C&#10;        C --&gt; A&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph SCC2&#10;        D --&gt; E&#10;        E --&gt; D&#10;    end&#10;    C --&gt; D\">graph LR\n    subgraph SCC1\n        A --&gt; B\n        B --&gt; C\n        C --&gt; A\n    end\n    subgraph SCC2\n        D --&gt; E\n        E --&gt; D\n    end\n    C --&gt; D</pre><p>SCC 在工程中的应用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>模块循环依赖检测</strong>：如果模块依赖图中存在包含 2+ 个模块的 SCC，就存在循环依赖</li>\n<li><strong>网页排名</strong>：Google 的 PageRank 算法利用了网页链接图的 SCC 结构</li>\n<li><strong>编译器优化</strong>：程序控制流图的 SCC 对应循环结构，用于循环优化</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>割点</strong>（Cut Vertex）和<strong>桥</strong>（Bridge）是连通性分析中的重要概念。删除割点后图不连通，删除桥后图不连通。在网络设计中，割点和桥代表单点故障——如果该节点或链路失效，整个网络将分裂。Tarjan 的 DFS 算法可以在 O(n+m) 时间内找到所有割点和桥。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最短路径算法\">最短路径算法</h2><p><strong>Dijkstra 算法</strong>解决非负权图的单源最短路径问题。使用优先队列（最小堆），时间复杂度 O((n+m) log n)。</p>\n<p><strong>Bellman-Ford 算法</strong>可以处理负权边（但不能有负权环），时间复杂度 O(nm)。它还能检测负权环的存在。</p>\n<p><strong>Floyd-Warshall 算法</strong>求解全源最短路径，时间复杂度 O(n³)。它与前面讨论的传递闭包（Warshall 算法）本质相同，只是将布尔运算替换为距离运算。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>问题类型</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>限制条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BFS</td>\n<td>单源最短（无权）</td>\n<td>O(n+m)</td>\n<td>无权图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dijkstra</td>\n<td>单源最短</td>\n<td>O((n+m)log n)</td>\n<td>非负权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bellman-Ford</td>\n<td>单源最短</td>\n<td>O(nm)</td>\n<td>可有负权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Floyd-Warshall</td>\n<td>全源最短</td>\n<td>O(n³)</td>\n<td>无负权环</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 Web 开发中，路由算法（如 React Router 的路径匹配）虽然不直接使用 Dijkstra，但地图导航、CDN 路由选择、网络路由协议（OSPF 使用 Dijkstra）都是最短路径算法的直接应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((图的遍历))&#10;    BFS&#10;      队列实现&#10;      最短路径&#10;      层次遍历&#10;      二部图判定&#10;    DFS&#10;      栈/递归&#10;      环检测&#10;      拓扑排序&#10;      强连通分量&#10;    连通性&#10;      连通分量&#10;      强连通分量&#10;      割点与桥&#10;    最短路径&#10;      Dijkstra&#10;      Bellman-Ford&#10;      Floyd-Warshall\">mindmap\n  root((图的遍历))\n    BFS\n      队列实现\n      最短路径\n      层次遍历\n      二部图判定\n    DFS\n      栈/递归\n      环检测\n      拓扑排序\n      强连通分量\n    连通性\n      连通分量\n      强连通分量\n      割点与桥\n    最短路径\n      Dijkstra\n      Bellman-Ford\n      Floyd-Warshall</pre><ul>\n<li>BFS 和 DFS 的时间复杂度都是 O(n+m)，区别在于遍历顺序和适用场景</li>\n<li>BFS 保证无权图的最短路径，DFS 擅长回溯、环检测和拓扑分析</li>\n<li>DFS 边分类中，回边的存在等价于图中有环</li>\n<li>强连通分量检测可用于模块循环依赖分析</li>\n<li>割点和桥是网络中的单点故障，Tarjan 算法可在线性时间内找到</li>\n<li>Dijkstra 适用于非负权图，Bellman-Ford 处理负权边，Floyd-Warshall 求全源最短路径</li>\n<li>图遍历算法是搜索引擎爬虫、社交网络分析和网络路由的核心工具</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图的遍历","id":"图的遍历"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"广度优先搜索（BFS）","id":"广度优先搜索-bfs"},{"level":2,"text":"深度优先搜索（DFS）","id":"深度优先搜索-dfs"},{"level":2,"text":"连通性与连通分量","id":"连通性与连通分量"},{"level":2,"text":"最短路径算法","id":"最短路径算法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图的基本概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/graph-theory/graph-concepts"},"next":{"title":"树与生成树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/graph-theory/trees-and-spanning"}}